        <h2 class="ll-slider__title">Philadelphia Rowhomes. LLumar Precision.</h2>
        <p class="ll-slider__desc">Philadelphia's housing stock runs heavily on single-pane glass — beautiful to look through, poor for heat retention in winter and solar control in summer. LLumar Low-E and ATC films are engineered for this: one insulates, one rejects heat, and both preserve the original window.</p>
