      <h3 class="ll-pl-row__heading">ATC Series — Non-Metallic Solar Control for Philadelphia Offices</h3>
      <p class="ll-pl-row__body">The ATC Series is LLumar's flagship architectural solar control film — a non-metallized spectrally selective product that rejects up to 74% of solar energy and 99% of UV radiation while maintaining high visible light transmission. Because the film contains no metal, it does not interfere with Wi-Fi, cellular, or building access signals. The neutral exterior appearance reads as clear glass from the street, meeting most Center City building management aesthetic requirements.</p>
      <p class="ll-pl-row__body">For Philadelphia's south- and west-facing offices, the ATC Series is available in VLT options from 20% to 70%. A lifecycle analysis found LLumar ATC film typically becomes carbon-negative within six months of installation on a commercial building due to HVAC energy savings. See how ATC fits into a full <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/" class="ll-body-link">energy savings strategy</a> for Philadelphia buildings.</p>

      <div class="ll-pl-row__specs">
        <div class="ll-pl-row__spec"><span class="ll-pl-row__spec-val">74%</span><span class="ll-pl-row__spec-label">Solar Rejection</span></div>
