      <h3 class="ll-pl-row__heading">Safety Series — Fragment Retention and Forced Entry Delay</h3>
      <p class="ll-pl-row__body">LLumar's Safety and Security Series is a polyester film engineered to hold shattered glass together on impact — protecting building occupants from flying fragments during break-ins, severe weather, and accidents. The film deters smash-and-grab theft by dramatically increasing forced entry time on retail storefront glass and is trusted by commercial properties throughout Philadelphia. Available from 4 mil (standard safety) to 8 mil (enhanced security). Our <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/" class="ll-body-link">safety and security window film</a> page covers the full range of options across brands.</p>
      <p class="ll-pl-row__body">In Philadelphia, LLumar safety film is most commonly installed on Old City and Center City retail storefronts for smash-and-grab deterrence, K-12 schools and universities, and healthcare facilities. Important: LLumar safety film holds glass together — it does not make glass unbreakable.</p>

