      <p class="ll-pl-row__body">LLumar's Reflective Privacy Series creates a mirror effect from outside during daylight hours, blocking inward views while maintaining clear outward visibility from inside. Philadelphia applications include restaurant dining rooms on Passyunk and Rittenhouse Square, west-facing conference rooms in Center City towers, and residential windows on busy street-facing facades.</p>
